                ref("INC-A1", "T-1"), ref("INC-A2", "T-2")), HttpStatus.CONFLICT);

        // 已持有生效租约的任务不能重复分配
        assertApiStatus(() -> assign(key(), "RES-A", T0.plusSeconds(7200), T0.plusSeconds(10800),
                ref("INC-A1", "T-1")), HttpStatus.CONFLICT);
    }

