                "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM command_keys WHERE command_key = 'LK-SAME'", Integer.class);
        assertThat(keyCount).isEqualTo(1);
    }

    @Test
    void concurrentAssign_overlappingPeriods_singleWinner() throws Exception {
